dsh-account-balance-badge README · Development：- `index.js` is an ES module exporting `apply()`.
- `client.js` is a lazy browser module in the `window.__ModuleLoader__.load({ id, factory })` format;
  it is served as-is, so keep it valid plain JavaScript (no JSX/TypeScript/`import`). Its factory
  resolves only `react` and `react-dom` from the page's frozen module table (no npm dependencies);
  `react-dom` is used solely to portal the recharge overlay out of the `shell.overlay` layer, the
  same approach the shipped account page uses.
